N46 M5 (Turn the Spindle off)
(2D Contour1)
N47 M9 (Turn Coolant off)
N48 M1 (Option Stop. If option Stop is enabled on the Console, the program will pause here. If not turned on this will be skipped and the program continues to the next tool)
N49 T10 M6 (Swap tool 14 for Tool 10 in the spindle
(.94" L.O.C.)
N50 T14 (Pre-load tool 14)
N51 S2410 M3 (Turn Spindle on to 2410 RPMs
N52 G54 (Work Reference Point)
N53 M8 (Coolant on)
N54 G0 X-1.2712 Y-0.03 (Rapid to a point a little distance away from the stock material)
N55 G43 Z0.6 H10 (height Offset for tool 10)
N56 Z0.2 (rapid to .200 above reference z point)
N57 G1 Z-0.51 F50. (Feed below Z reference point .510" at 50 Inches/Minute - IPM)
N58 G41 X-1.2413 Y-0.2363 D10 F10. (G41-Turn Right hand Cutter compensation on, D-Diameter call out in offsets, Feed at 10IPM
N59 G3 X-1.005 Y0. I0. J0.2363 (Arc Movemenent into cut)
N60 G1 Y1. (Feed Along Y axis)
